WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.512
A common analytical question is: what are the top few records inside every group?

00:00:05.512 --> 00:00:10.576
For example, we may want the two highest-paid employees in each department.

00:00:11.169 --> 00:00:13.601
The usual pattern has two steps.

00:00:13.601 --> 00:00:17.351
First, calculate a ranking inside each department.

00:00:17.351 --> 00:00:21.296
Second, filter the ranked result in an outer query.

00:00:21.296 --> 00:00:28.420
This is a good place for a common table expression because it gives the ranked stage a clear name before we filter it.
